le":"","content":"Perception + Awareness = 7 dice<br /> <br /> 1,5,6,3,1,3,1<br /> <br /> Well, we're off to a cracking start.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-29T06:09:32-07:00","id":1109202,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CapitanTypo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1107991-play-by-post-what-lurks-beneath-the-waves-ooc-thread?p=1109135#post1109135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perception + Awareness = 7 dice<br /> <br /> 1,5,6,3,1,3,1<br /> <br /> Well, we're off to a cracking start.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's like, negative 3 successes if you were trying to notice Hope's Last Gasp. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T15:51:41-07:00","id":1109954,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure if Praxae and Crow are trying to shuffle Hope off and out of danger or not, so Hope's being stubborn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T15:56:50-07:00","id":1109955,"title":"","content":"Its fair to be stubborn about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T17:13:53-07:00","id":1109972,"title":"","content":"A question about sorcery and Cirrus Skiff - do you read it that the caster must be on the Skiff while it is cast? (It's not Morris control spell) or could 2 archers go up on it?<br /> <br /> Also, the roll for Mirrins scarred by nightmares shaping ritual = 8 successes (the roll must be seen to be believed <a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/x6PJMAZ.png\" target=\"_blank\">https://i.imgur.com/x6PJMAZ.png</a>)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T17:19:23-07:00","id":1109974,"title":"","content":"Casting roll: using 5 dice from occult excellency on the first roll for 11 dice = 4 successes, same on second roll, 11 dice = 9 successes (4 10s!!!) so if we're in normal initiative time it take mirrin two rounds to cast the Cirrus Skiff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T18:21:57-07:00","id":1109986,"title":"","content":"Caster + 1 more passenger. Because the caster has to direct/pilot the skiff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T18:28:46-07:00","id":1109989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NickLance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1107991-play-by-post-what-lurks-beneath-the-waves-ooc-thread?p=1109986#post1109986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Caster + 1 more passenger. Because the caster has to direct/pilot the skiff.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Cool. Mirrin's going a skiff-ing, then.<br /> <br /> Regarding the IC post - Mirrin is keeping the cloud basically one range band from the ship, and staying as out-of-sight as possible using the Ships sails as cover. If the black ship tries to board them or draw too close and start firing arrows, the plan is to circle around at a similar distance to let the archer fire freely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":8520,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","user":"CapitanTypo","date":". 06-30-2017, 09:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T11:22:49-07:00","id":1110273,"title":"","content":"Not really sure what else to do until the combat starts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T12:05:07-07:00","id":1110289,"title":"","content":"While Paxrae would never ask one so young to participate in battle and would advise against it, he won't argue the point.<br /> <br /> Activating Graceful Crane Stance in preparation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3976,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","user":"Silent Witness","date":".  Added Charm activation 07-01-2017, 04:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T17:26:27-07:00","id":1110417,"title":"","content":"Given that Paxrae has asked the Gleaming Pearl to stand down while the Mollusk moves to intercept, I think in the grand scheme of things Paxrae is within his right to make a strategic maneuver if he wants.<br /> <br /> If he's just going to wait then please let me know so that I can proceed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T18:03:13-07:00","id":1110423,"title":"","content":"Paxrae activates Wind-Defying Course Technique and, combining his knowledge of seamanship and naval combat, is going to attempt the Strategic Placement Stratagem by using any unusual tidal and wind disturbances caused by the presence of the mysterious island to his advantage. the goal is to give the opposing vessel escape route but away from the Gleaming Pearl and out of our path back to Haven.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-01T23:48:33-07:00","id":1110482,"title":"","content":"Make a roll for your Strategic Placement strategem.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T08:01:08-07:00","id":1110546,"title":"","content":"I have edited the backstory for Hope's Last Gasp. She no longer has a sifu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T08:55:13-07:00","id":1110560,"title":"","content":"Intelligence+War+Naval Battle Specialty (5 dice)= (2,4,7,10,10) 5 Successes!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T07:55:39-07:00","id":1110851,"title":"","content":"I'll post in the morning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T15:27:36-07:00","id":1111425,"title":"","content":"Hope is spending 3 motes from her peripheral pool to activate Blinding Battle Feint. She's also spending 10 motes from her personal pool to do a full Dex+Stealth excellency. I am assuming none of them are dead or undead, so I'm only rolling 20 dice.<br /> <br /> Roll:<br /> 7 1 2 8 9 5 2 10 9 9 4 6 3 1 9 8 3 8 10 3<br /> <br /> By my count that's 12 successes. Due to Five-Fold Shadow Burial any 1s they roll on an awareness roll to spot me, such as this join battle one per Blinding Battle Feint, gives them -2 success. Up to you GM if that effects their initiative or just their ability to spot me, since it's unlcear by the rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T16:27:14-07:00","id":1111450,"title":"","content":"It affects their ability to spot you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T16:36:55-07:00","id":1111456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NickLance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1107991-play-by-post-what-lurks-beneath-the-waves-ooc-thread?p=1111450#post1111450\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It affects their ability to spot you.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Makes sense. How many successes did they get on their join battle anyway? Is Hope stealthed successfully?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T17:58:50-07:00","id":1111480,"title":"","content":"Join Battle = 3 successes<br /> <br /> Mirrin's plan with positioning the cloud is to be in such a location that if anyone turns to attack the cloud, they must expose their flanks or back to the fighters on our ship. Otherwise, staying elevated and whatever minimum distance is required for archery (one range band?) away from the ships.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitantypo","name":"CapitanTypo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8520_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"896"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T19:02:44-07:00","id":1111495,"title":"","content":"Boarding party Join Battle = 3 success<br /> Archer party Join Battle = 2 success<br /> Axe Boss Join Battle = 4 success<br /> Sword Boss Join Battle = 3 success<br /> Brilliant Snow Crow Join Battle = 9 success<br /> <br /> Hope doesn't know if she succeeded at her stealth, but what she can observe so far is that nobody has paid any attention to her.<br /> <br /> Mirrin your position due to height is already 1 range band away, and because you're at the sails it would take effort to climb up to get at you, so you are clear to direct the archer with you to fire.<br /> <br /> Waiting on Pax.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":13507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","user":"NickLance","date":". 07-04-2017, 10:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T19:37:26-07:00","id":1111506,"title":"","content":"So Hope is sitting at 15i. I guess that's what you get for blowing a full excellency on join battle.<br /> <br /> I should probably not that on the post that has my sheet. Might as well put all the fiddly bits that change to fast to be worth tracking via PDF.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T20:11:15-07:00","id":1111523,"title":"","content":"Paxrae's JB(1,3,4,4,6,7=1 Success+3)=4<br /> Murder at Sea (1,3,6,7,8,10=4 Successes+3)=7<br /> <br /> Not sure if Medium Infantry or Grizzled Mercenary QC stats are more appropriate to represent my crew as battle group, but they have the same Join Battle pool. All Command Merit states is that they are Size 3, Might 0, Average Drill (which will give them a +1 Defense). Paxrae will activate War God Descendent to increase their effective size by 1 (presumably drawing the extra hands from the Gleaming Pearl?) he will then trust his crew to neutralize the archers and secure the deck of the Pearl, while he draws Tsunami's Apex and moves in to focus on the leadership.<br /> <br /> Paxrae has spent 6 Personal and 3 Peripheral Essence thus far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3976,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","user":"Silent Witness","date":".  Added Essence expenditure 07-04-2017, 11:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T03:29:41-07:00","id":1111599,"title":"","content":"Initiative order. Hope, Crow, Murder, Axe Boss &amp; Paxrae, Boarding Party &amp; Sword Boss &amp; Mirrin, Archer Party.<br /> <br /> Proceed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T04:33:04-07:00","id":1111610,"title":"","content":"Before I do something, which QC are the boarding party? I want to know their defense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T06:25:55-07:00","id":1111632,"title":"","content":"They are medium infantry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T15:41:49-07:00","id":1111848,"title":"","content":"Okay. So I'm stealthed, which means I am either ambushing and they have Defense 0, or they aren't expecting me and they get -2 to their defense. In either case, Hope will spend a willpower on her melee roll. She's flurrying so she gets -3 dice for each of her actions. So 6 for her dex+melee roll, and 7 for her dex+stealth roll.<br /> <br /> Dex+Melee: <br /> 6 1 9 7 6 2 <br /> 3 successes once you include the willpower expenditure.<br /> <br /> Dex+Stealth: <br /> 8 10 2 9 6 3 4 <br /> <br /> Four successes by my count.<br /> <br /> Assuming her decisive attack hits, I will roll for damage.<br /> <br /> 5 1 10 3 4 3 7 3 3 1 3 2 7 10 1 <br /> 5 successes, and since I rolled 15 dice I get +3 automatic levels of damage.for a total of 8 if I did my math right.<br /> <br /> <br /> Is everything correct GM?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T15:52:21-07:00","id":1111854,"title":"","content":"You are correct and yes your attack is resolved successfully. They are battle-ready troops.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T15:54:15-07:00","id":1111856,"title":"","content":"Right then. Hope's initiative resets to 3. Does she successfully re-establish stealth?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T16:03:47-07:00","id":1111864,"title":"","content":"<br /> You failed to re-establish stealth. But Crow is covering for you.<br /> <br /> The initiative order is posted up so please go ahead when its your turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T16:15:41-07:00","id":1111873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NickLance</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1107991-play-by-post-what-lurks-beneath-the-waves-ooc-thread?p=1111864#post1111864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You failed to re-establish stealth..</div> </div> </div> </div>Wow. They must have rolled like gangbusters. I rolled as many successes on my stealth roll as they had dice.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11917,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","user":"Aranfan","date":". 07-05-2017, 07:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T18:31:17-07:00","id":1111925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aranfan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/1107991-play-by-post-what-lurks-beneath-the-waves-ooc-thread?p=1111873#post1111873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Wow. They must have rolled like gangbusters. I rolled as many successes on my stealth roll as they had dice.</div> </div> </div> </div>They got lucky, really really lucky. Too bad they probably can't hit you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13507-nicklance","name":"NickLance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13507_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T19:20:19-07:00","id":1111938,"title":"","content":"Crew's attack (7 dice for chopping swords+3 Size Modifier)=10 dice(1,3,4,5,6,6,7,8,8,10)=5 successes withering attack vs. archer Battle Group.<br /> <br /> If my math is right, that's 7 damage after soak: (2,2,5,6,7,7,9,9)=4 successes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3976,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","user":"Silent Witness","date":".  Added damage roll 07-05-2017, 10:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3976-silent-witness","name":"Silent Witness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3976_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"138"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T15:17:13-07:00","id":1112371,"title":"","content":"I am now confused. Who is next in initiative order? Did the arrows hit anyone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11917-aranfan","name":"Aranfan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11917_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"503"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T15:27:30-07:00","id":1112377,"title":"","content":"When it's Mirrin's turn, the archer is directed to fire at the enemy archers - while Mirrin continues to maneuver the cloud to keep them to the side of the attackers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Visit me at <a href=\"http://www.bragrman.com\" target=\"_blank\"><i>Tales of Grey</i></a> - my RPG Game-Master's blog.<br /> <br /> &quot;If only I had an enemy bigger than my apathy, I could have won&quot; - <i>I gave you all,</i> Mumford &amp; Sons","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8520-capitan